      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>In the name of God, the merciful, the compassionate.</li>\n<li>The amount of \u1e0dar\u012bbas of sugarcane that the warrantors have collected with regard to the plants:&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Fifty-four \u1e0dar\u012bbas and one sixth.</li>\n<li>The monetary value of each \u1e0dar\u012bba that they have collected is 35 d\u012bn\u0101rs</li>\n<li>Giving a total of 1,896 d\u012bn\u0101rs.</li>\n<li>The amount it yields if the plants are cultivated, from each&nbsp;</li>\n<li>\u1e0dar\u012bba, is 5 qin\u1e6d\u0101rs, a half and a quarter of &ldquo;red&rdquo; (raw) sugar,</li>\n<li>the price of which is 55 d\u012bn\u0101rs, from which there is subtracted the price</li>\n<li>of working it by hand, and (for) the press, 5 d\u012bn\u0101rs.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
